~ start
~ win_questions
- Why in the middle of summer it is snowy? => snow_qa
- What do you know about my friends' locations? => friends_qa
- How did you end up here? => peng_qa
- I have no more questions left => bye

~ snow_qa
Penguin: You truly think this is weather?
Penguin: No. We brought it here.
Penguin: Ships. Ice cores. Atmospheric triggers.
Penguin: We turned summer into winter.

- Why?
Penguin: Snow slows wings.
Penguin: Snow divides flocks.
Penguin: Snow makes control… easier. => win_questions


~ friends_qa
Penguin: Your flock is secured.

Pigeon: Secured where?

Penguin: Northern ridge. Beyond the frozen river.
Penguin: Old observatory grounds.

Pigeon: That’s outside migration territory.

Penguin: Exactly.
Penguin: Hard to leave.
Penguin: Harder to be found. => win_questions


~ peng_qa
Penguin: I did not end up here.
Penguin: I built this.

Pigeon: Built what?

Penguin: The storm.
Penguin: The relocation.
Penguin: The new order.

Penguin: Penguins do not wait for seasons anymore. => win_questions

~ bye
Penguin: Ok. I've ever met you, you've never met me.
Penguin: Otherwise don't hope that I'll spare your life.
- Agreed.
Penguin: Go away then.
Pigeon: Goodbye.
